  "descripcion": "The A3E expands SubwaySim 2 with another classic of Berlin's small-profile network. Between 2002 and 2005, 28 twin units of the A3 64 and A3 66 series were refurbished with chopper control and an updated passenger interior. You can now drive them yourself.",
